Cross-platform port and author-modified build (this repository)
---------------------------------------------------------------
The CMake build scripts, vcpkg manifest, the platform_compat.h shim, and
the portability edits required to remove Windows-only constructs
(windows.h, _tmain, _TCHAR, GetTickCount, <strstream>, stdafx.h) are
provided here together with an author-modified command-line build.

The author modifications are deliberately limited in scope but are not
algorithmically neutral: (1) `train` and `train-update` command-line
subcommands expose the ANN training/update entry points used by the
reproducible benchmark, and (2) `FLUS_RANDOM_SEED` deterministically seeds
the ANN sampling stage and the CA roulette stage, with a time-based seed as
the fallback when the variable is absent or invalid. These changes alter
the execution interface and random stream relative to the GeoSOS release;
they do not claim to be part of the upstream FLUS implementation.

This repository is offered under the same non-commercial academic research
terms that apply to the upstream FLUS source it derives from. It does not,
and cannot, grant any additional license to the underlying FLUS source code
or the ALGLIB code. The author-modified changes are provided for transparent
reconstruction of the accompanying benchmark and should not be read as an
official GeoSOS release.
